  "description": "Seo Eun-Gyu, who was promoted to deputy director, the youngest in history, and transferred to the International Contracts Team, is not pleased to see Mun Da-Won, a colleague from his new-hire training class who always finished second behind him. However, Seo Eun-Gyu, this man, is excessively kind to Da-Won. Da-Won ends up sleeping with Eun-Gyu after a night of drinking, and ever since then, Eun-Gyu has been clinging to her, saying:\n\n*“Think of me as a toy, a sex toy you use when you’re stressed.”*\n\nShe gradually begins to feel drawn to this seemingly perfect man who wants to give her everything.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
